--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
training/3b1b/videos/   (Git submodule; not populated by default)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:  https://github.com/3b1b/videos
Author:  Grant Sanderson (3Blue1Brown)
License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
         (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

This directory is registered as a git submodule. A fresh clone of NIMA will see
an empty `training/3b1b/videos/` until the user explicitly runs:

    git submodule update --init --recursive

The snapshot is used as a retrieval corpus of golden Manim examples by the RAG
layer. NIMA itself does not redistribute the 3Blue1Brown source code;
initializing the submodule fetches it directly from the upstream repository.

Important: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 is a non-commercial license. Downstream users who
initialize this submodule must respect its NonCommercial clause when using or
redistributing derivative works of the 3Blue1Brown corpus. NIMA's Apache-2.0
grant applies only to NIMA's own code — not to the 3Blue1Brown material.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
skills/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `skills/` directory contains agentic-coding skill bundles (SKILL.md packs
used by Claude Code / Qwen Code and similar tools). Individual bundles may be
derived from or inspired by Anthropic's public skills documentation and
examples.

Per-bundle licensing:

  skills/mcp-builder/                Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE.txt bundled)
  skills/skill-creator/              Derived from Anthropic examples; use at
                                     own discretion, consult upstream terms.
  skills/changelog-generator/        Original to NIMA — Apache-2.0.
  skills/fastapi/                    Original to NIMA — Apache-2.0.
  skills/frontend-design/            Derived from Anthropic examples.
  skills/tailored-resume-generator/  Derived from Anthropic examples.
  skills/webapp-testing/             Derived from Anthropic examples.

These bundles are not required to run NIMA's generation pipeline. They exist to
support agentic coding assistants operating on this repository. Consult the
SKILL.md and any LICENSE files within each bundle for specifics.

